q q .721569 .776471 .819608 RG .4 w 46.8 38.16 m 565.2 38.16 l S .356863 .396078 .45098 rg BT 8.64 TL/F1 7.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 46.8 25.2 Tm (BEYONDX )Tj[-4779.9997]TJ ( | Oracle 19c on Exadata to Amazon Aurora MySQL 8.0)Tj T* ET BT 1 0 0 1 538.38 25.2 Tm (Page 18)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 52.8 722.36 cm .090196 .211765 .364706 rg BT 19 TL/F2 16 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 3 Tm (14. Engineering Lessons Learned)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 52.8 687.36 cm .14902 .196078 .219608 rg BT 13 TL/F1 9.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 7 16.9 Tm <7f20>Tj/F2 9.1 Tf (Preserve capability, not just objects.)Tj/F1 9.1 Tf ( More than 35 years of embedded business behavior required manual semantic)Tj T* 7 0 Td (analysis.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 52.8 655.36 cm .14902 .196078 .219608 rg BT 13 TL/F1 9.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 7 16.9 Tm <7f20>Tj/F2 9.1 Tf (Treat SCT output as a skeleton.)Tj/F1 9.1 Tf ( Automated conversion accelerates assessment; production architecture requires human)Tj T* 7 0 Td (review.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 52.8 623.36 cm .14902 .196078 .219608 rg BT 13 TL/F1 9.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 7 16.9 Tm <7f20>Tj/F2 9.1 Tf (Let production metadata govern when lower environments drift.)Tj/F1 9.1 Tf ( Production-derived DMS mappings enabled)Tj T* 7 0 Td (meaningful rehearsals.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 52.8 604.36 cm .14902 .196078 .219608 rg BT 13 TL/F1 9.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 7 3.9 Tm <7f20>Tj/F2 9.1 Tf (Decompose by risk and design for failure.)Tj/F1 9.1 Tf ( Large tables and LOBs need restartable, observable migration paths.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 52.8 585.36 cm .14902 .196078 .219608 rg BT 13 TL/F1 9.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 7 3.9 Tm <7f20>Tj/F2 9.1 Tf (Engineer rollback.)Tj/F1 9.1 Tf ( Reverse CDC, binlog retention, and validated LOB handling make fallback executable.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 52.8 553.36 cm .14902 .196078 .219608 rg BT 13 TL/F1 9.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 7 16.9 Tm <7f20>Tj/F2 9.1 Tf (Re-engineer target performance.)Tj/F1 9.1 Tf ( Exadata-era assumptions must be replaced with Aurora workload evidence,)Tj T* 7 0 Td (composite-index tuning, and application testing.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 52.8 521.36 cm .14902 .196078 .219608 rg BT 13 TL/F1 9.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 7 16.9 Tm <7f20>Tj/F2 9.1 Tf (Use external guidance as input, not prescription.)Tj/F1 9.1 Tf ( Documentation, blogs, and AI suggestions are hypotheses until)Tj T* 7 0 Td (validated against the real environment.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 52.8 502.36 cm .14902 .196078 .219608 rg BT 13 TL/F1 9.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 7 3.9 Tm <7f20>Tj/F2 9.1 Tf (Govern indexes throughout their lifecycle.)Tj/F1 9.1 Tf ( Redundant and unused-index analysis belongs in steady-state operations.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 52.8 470.36 cm .14902 .196078 .219608 rg BT 13 TL/F1 9.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 7 16.9 Tm <7f20>Tj/F2 9.1 Tf (Use AI under human engineering control.)Tj/F1 9.1 Tf ( AI expands analysis capacity and challenges omissions; accountable)Tj T* 7 0 Td (engineers own correctness.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 52.8 438.36 cm .14902 .196078 .219608 rg BT 13 TL/F1 9.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 7 16.9 Tm <7f20>Tj/F2 9.1 Tf (Measure completion by retirement.)Tj/F1 9.1 Tf ( A modernization proves itself when the target operates successfully and the legacy)Tj T* 7 0 Td (source can be decommissioned with confidence.)Tj T* ET Q Q

