 rg BT 13 TL/F1 9.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 55.9 Tm (The migration completed successfully with negligible issues. Following cutover, the Aurora MySQL environment operated)Tj T* (through approximately two months of stabilization and operational validation. Once application behavior, data integrity,)Tj T* (performance, jobs, monitoring, and operational readiness had demonstrated sustained confidence, the legacy Oracle source)Tj T* (system was decommissioned. The enduring lesson is straightforward: tools provide leverage, but confidence comes from)Tj T* (engineering evidence - and modernization is complete only when the legacy platform can be retired with confidence.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 57.6 237.46 cm .917647 .94902 .972549 rg 0 38.4 82.8 -38.4 re f* .972549 .984314 .992157 rg 82.8 38.4 414 -38.4 re f* q 1 0 0 1 8 10.2 cm .090196 .211765 .364706 rg BT 9 TL/F2 7.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 14.85625 10.5 Tm (BEYONDX)Tj T* -7.28625 0 Td (COMMITMENT)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 90.8 8 cm .14902 .196078 .219608 rg BT 11.2 TL/F2 8.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 2.8254 13.8 Tm (A migration ends at cutover. A modernization ends when the legacy platform can be retired with)Tj T* 172.2795 0 Td (confidence.)Tj T* ET Q q .721569 .776471 .819608 RG 1 J 1 j .8 w 0 38.4 m 496.8 38.4 l S 0 0 m 496.8 0 l S 0 0 m 0 38.4 l S 496.8 0 m 496.8 38.4 l S .4 w 82.8 0 m 82.8 38.4 l S Q Q Q

